ton></div></div></article>`}).join('')}</div>`}).join('')}`}
+function usersView(){let rows=[...(state.users?.users||[])];const q=state.userQ.trim().toLowerCase();if(q)rows=rows.filter(u=>String(u.email||'').toLowerCase().includes(q));if(state.userRole!=='all')rows=rows.filter(u=>u.role===state.userRole);const grouped=['admin','subadmin','user'];return `<div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">ACCOUNT CONTROL · 9.6.12</div><div class="section-title">사용자 관리</div><div class="section-desc">운영 역할과 서비스 등급을 분리하고, 일·월 사용량과 적립 Credit을 같은 화면에서 확인합니다.</div></div></div><div class="card user-toolbar"><div class="search-line"><input id="user-q" placeholder="이메일 검색" value="${esc(state.userQ)}"><button class="btn" data-action="user-search">검색</button></div><div class="segmented user-filter"><button class="segment ${state.userRole==='all'?'on':''}" data-action="user-role-filter" data-role="all">전체</button><button class="segment ${state.userRole==='admin'?'on':''}" data-action="user-role-filter" data-role="admin">관리자</button><button class="segment ${state.userRole==='subadmin'?'on':''}" data-action="user-role-filter" data-role="subadmin">부관리자</button><button class="segment ${state.userRole==='user'?'on':''}" data-action="user-role-filter" data-role="user">사용자</button></div></div>${state.busy?loading():grouped.map(role=>{const items=rows.filter(u=>u.role===role);if(!items.length)return'';return `<div class="role-group"><span>${roleLabel(role)}</span><b>${fmt(items.length)}</b></div><div class="user-list modern">${items.map(u=>{const op=!!u.isOperator||u.role!=='user',q=u.quota||{},daily=quotaLimitText(q.displayUsed??q.used,q.limit,q.unlimited),monthly=quotaLimitText(q.displayMonthlyUsed??q.monthlyUsed,q.monthlyLimit,op||q.monthlyLimit==null);return `<article class="card user-card modern"><div class="user-head"><div class="user-identity"><div class="email">${esc(u.email)}</div><div class="meta">가입 ${dateText(u.createdAt)} · 최근 ${dateText(u.lastLoginAt)}</div></div><div class="user-badges"><span class="pill ${role==='admin'?'red':role==='subadmin'?'purple':'blue'}">${roleLabel(role)}</span><span class="pill ${op?'':'amber'}">${op?'등급 없음':tierLabel(u.serviceTier)}</span></div></div><div class="account-metrics"><div><span>일일 사용</span><b>${daily}</b></div><div><span>월간 사용</span><b>${monthly}</b></div><div><span>적립 Credit</span><b>${op?'해당 없음':fmt(u.credits??q.credits??0)}</b></div><div><span>연구자료</span><b>${fmt(u.researchSampleCount)}건</b></div></div><div class="user-foot"><span class="tiny muted">${op?'운영자는 등급·Credit 차감 대상이 아닙니다.':`개인 한도 ${q.source==='override'?'직접 지정':'등급 기본값'} · API ${u.hasApiKey?'등록':'미등록'}`}</span><div class="btn-row compact"><button class="btn small primary" data-action="account-settings" data-id="${esc(u.id)}" data-email="${esc(u.email)}">계정 설정</button><button class="btn small" data-action="user-research" data-id="${esc(u.id)}">연구자료</button><button class="btn danger small" data-action="delete-user" data-id="${esc(u.id)}" data-email="${esc(u.email)}">삭제</button></div></div></article>`}).join('')}</div>`}).join('')}`}
 async function openAccountSettings(id,email){try{const d=await api(`/platform-api/admin/users/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/account`);document.getElementById('account-modal')?.remove();const op=!!d.isOperator,ov=d.override||{},dm=limitMode(ov,'dailyLimit'),mm=limitMode(ov,'monthlyLimit'),policies=(d.policies||[]).filter(x=>x.isEnabled);const modal=document.createElement('div');modal.id='account-modal';modal.className='modal-backdrop';modal.innerHTML=`<section class="account-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><div class="sheet-grab"></div><header class="sheet-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">ACCOUNT SETTINGS</div><h2>계정 설정</h2><p>${esc(d.email||email||'')}</p></div><button class="sheet-close" data-account-close aria-label="닫기">×</button></header><form id="account-form" class="sheet-body"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="${esc(d.tierRevision)}"><label class="field"><span>운영 역할</span><select name="role"><option value="user" ${d.role==='user'?'selected':''}>사용자</option><option value="subadmin" ${d.role==='subadmin'?'selected':''}>부관리자</option><option value="admin" ${d.role==='admin'?'selected':''}>관리자</option></select><small>관리자·부관리자는 서비스 등급과 Credit 집행 대상이 아닙니다.</small></label><div class="operator-note ${op?'show':''}" id="operator-note">현재 운영자 계정입니다. 등급·개인 한도·Credit은 적용하지 않습니다.</div><div id="tier-fields" class="tier-fields ${op?'disabled':''}"><label class="field"><span>서비스 등급</span><select name="serviceTier">${policies.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.tier)}" ${d.serviceTier===x.tier?'selected':''}>${esc(x.displayName||tierLabel(x.tier))} · 일 ${x.dailyLimit==null?'무제한':fmt(x.dailyLimit)} / 월 ${x.monthlyLimit==null?'무제한':fmt(x.monthlyLimit)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><div class="limit-pair"><div class="limit-editor"><label class="field"><span>개인 일간 한도</span><select name="dailyMode">${limitModeOptions(dm)}</select></label><label class="field custom-limit ${dm==='custom'?'show':''}" data-custom="daily"><span>직접 지정</span><input name="dailyLimit" type="number" min="0" max="10000" value="${dm==='custom'?esc(ov.dailyLimit):''}"></label></div><div class="limit-editor"><label class="field"><span>개인 월간 한도</span><select name="monthlyMode">${limitModeOptions(mm)}</select></label><label class="field custom-limit ${mm==='custom'?'show':''}" data-custom="monthly"><span>직접 지정</span><input name="monthlyLimit" type="number" min="0" max="100000" value="${mm==='custom'?esc(ov.monthlyLimit):''}"></label></div></div><label class="field"><span>Credit 추가/차감</span><input name="creditDelta" type="number" step="1" value="0"><small>현재 ${fmt(d.credits??0)} Credit · 차감은 음수로 입력합니다.</small></label></div><label class="field"><span>변경 사유</span><input name="reason" maxlength="200" placeholder="예: Writer 전환 / 프로모션 Credit 지급"></label><div class="account-summary"><span>현재 일일</span><b>${quotaLimitText(d.quota?.displayUsed??d.quota?.used,d.quota?.limit,d.quota?.unlimited)}</b><span>현재 월간</span><b>${quotaLimitText(d.quota?.displayMonthlyUsed??d.quota?.monthlyUsed,d.quota?.monthlyLimit,op||d.quota?.monthlyLimit==null)}</b></div><button class="btn primary full" type="submit">계정 설정 저장</button></form></section>`;document.body.appendChild(modal);const close=()=>modal.remove();modal.querySelector('[data-account-close]').onclick=close;modal.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===modal)close()});const form=modal.querySelector('#account-form');const sync=()=>{const role=form.elements.role.value,isOp=role!=='user',fields=modal.querySelector('#tier-fields');fields.classList.toggle('disabled',isOp);modal.querySelector('#operator-note').classList.toggle('show',isOp);for(const el of fields.querySelectorAll('input,select'))el.disabled=isOp;for(const key of ['daily','monthly']){const mode=form.elements[key+'Mode']?.value;modal.querySelector(`[data-custom="${key}"]`)?.classList.toggle('show',mode==='custom')}};form.elements.role.addEventListener('change',sync);form.elements.dailyMode?.addEventListener('change',sync);form.elements.monthlyMode?.addEventListener('change',sync);sync();form.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(form),role=String(fd.get('role')||'user'),body={expectedRevision:Number(fd.get('revision')),role,reason:String(fd.get('reason')||'').trim()};if(role==='user'){body.serviceTier=String(fd.get('serviceTier')||'free');body.override={};for(const [key,modeName,valName] of [['dailyLimit','dailyMode','dailyLimit'],['monthlyLimit','monthlyMode','monthlyLimit']]){const mode=String(fd.get(modeName)||'default');if(mode==='unlimited')body.override[key]=null;else if(mode==='custom'){const n=Number(fd.get(valName));if(!Number.isFinite(n)||n<0)return toast('개인 한도 값을 확인하세요.');body.override[key]=Math.trunc(n)}}const delta=Number(fd.get('creditDelta')||0);if(!Number.isSafeInteger(delta))return toast('Credit 조정값은 정수로 입력하세요.');body.creditDelta=delta}const submit=form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');submit.disabled=true;submit.textContent='저장 중…';try{await api(`/platform-api/admin/users/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/account`,json('PATCH',body));await loadUsers(false);toast('계정 설정을 저장했습니다.');close();render()}catch(err){toast(err.message);submit.disabled=false;submit.textContent='계정 설정 저장'}})}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
 function settingsView(){const s=state.settings;if(!s)return state.busy?loading():`<div class="card empty">운영 설정을 불러오지 못했습니다.</div>`;return `<div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">SERVICE CONTROL</div><div class="section-title">운영 설정</div><div class="section-desc">서버 공개 상태·작업실 자원·AI 기본값·분석 한도를 제어합니다.</div></div></div><section class="card maintenance ${s.serviceClosed?'closed':''}"><div class="switchline"><div><h3 style="margin:0">점검 모드</h3><p class="hint" style="margin:4px 0 0">켜면 일반 사용자의 새 AI 작업을 제한하고 진행 작업을 중단 처리합니다.</p></div><label class="switch"><input id="service-closed" type="checkbox" ${s.serviceClosed?'checked':''} ${state.serviceChanging?'disabled':''}><span></span></label></div></section><form class="card setting-card" id="access-form"><h3>작업실 자원</h3><p class="hint">동시 접속과 분석 병렬도를 조절합니다.</p><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>동시 작업실 수</span><input name="maxConcurrentWorkspaces" type="number" min="1" max="200" value="${s.maxConcurrentWorkspaces}"></label><label class="field"><span>동시 분석 작품 수</span><input name="maxParallelAnalysisJobs" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="${s.maxParallelAnalysisJobs??2}"></label><label class="field"><span>관리자 예약 슬롯</span><input name="staffReservedSlots" type="number" min="0" max="20" value="${s.staffReservedSlots}"></label><label class="field"><span>유휴 해제(분)</span><input name="workspaceIdleMinutes" type="number" min="5" max="240" value="${s.idleMinutes??s.workspaceIdleMinutes??30}"></label></div><button class="btn primary full" type="submit">작업실 설정 저장</button></form><form class="card setting-card" id="ai-form"><h3>AI 기본 설정</h3><p class="hint">실행 중 작업과 기존 결과에는 영향을 주지 않습니다.</p><label class="field"><span>추론 수준</span><select name="reasoningEffort"><option value="minimal" ${(s.aiDefaults?.reasoningEffort||'medium')==='minimal'?'selected':''}>최소</option><option value="low" ${(s.aiDefaults?.reasoningEffort||'medium')==='low'?'selected':''}>낮음</option><option value="medium" ${(s.aiDefaults?.reasoningEffort||'medium')==='medium'?'selected':''}>보통</option><option value="high" ${(s.aiDefaults?.reasoningEffort||'medium')==='high'?'selected':''}>높음</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>적용 범위</span><select name="scope"><option value="new">미설정 항목 기본값만</option><option value="all">모든 사용자 기존 값도 변경</option></select></label><button class="btn primary full" type="submit">AI 기본값 적용</button></form><form class="card setting-card" id="limit-form"><h3>기본 분석 한도</h3><p class="hint">개별 설정이 없는 일반 사용자에게 적용됩니다.</p><label class="field"><span>기본 일일 분석 횟수</span><input name="defaultDailyAnalysisLimit" type="number" min="1" max="1000" value="${s.defaultDailyAnalysisLimit}"></label><button class="btn primary full" type="submit">기본 한도 저장</button></form>`}
 function moreHome(){return `<div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">ADMIN TOOLS</div><div class="section-title">더보기</div><div class="section-desc">자주 보지 않는 운영 도구와 읽기 전용 현황입니다.</div></div></div><div class="more-menu"><button class="more-link" data-action="more" data-id="usage"><div><strong>사용 현황 · 서버 자원</strong><span>통계, 접속 대기열, 메모리·Docker 상태</span></div><b>›</b></button><button class="more-link" data-action="more" data-id="announcements"><div><strong>공지사항 관리</strong><span>공지 작성·수정·보관</span></div><b>›</b></button><button class="more-link" data-action="more" data-id="backups"><div><strong>백업</strong><span>백업 정책, 수동 백업, 복원</span></div><b>›</b></button><button class="more-link" data-action="clear-temp"><div><strong>앱 임시 데이터 정리</strong><span>관리자 앱 WebView 캐시만 정리</span></div><b>›</b></button><button class="more-link" data-action="logout"><div><strong style="color:#b91c1c">로그아웃</strong><span>관리자 세션 종료</span></div><b>›</b></button></div>`}
